    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334660/extras/8730af7aadd5fb5d8ceab5ab9cc8ce4a.avif?t=1739546695\" data-has-big width=800 height=281 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334660/extras/9360eb937f87a5ab53418f849d8be99c.avif?t=1739546695\" data-has-big width=800 height=188 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334660/extras/475973a2d509c2cdb962e3af05724ea5.poster.avif?t=1739546695\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334660/extras/475973a2d509c2cdb962e3af05724ea5.webm?t=1739546695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334660/extras/475973a2d509c2cdb962e3af05724ea5.mp4?t=1739546695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334660/extras/d79e9adc0f524aa3bd7c39ef7c1854db.avif?t=1739546695\" data-has-big width=800 height=354 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;What if there is a living thing inside a computer?&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winion is a data-type creature that lives in a digital environment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can think themselves and can feel emotions such as happiness and depression like humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In modern society, Winion is recognized as an important creature and classified as a living thing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The country strictly manages and protects Winion, and Little Winion grows safely in the [Winion Repository].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adult Winion is assigned various roles and works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Therefore, it is illegal for an individual to raise Winion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Huh?... Do you want to raise Winion?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ah. Then you've come to the right place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also raise Little Winion here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Winions with unique personalities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Winions depicted in cute pixel graphics await you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334660/extras/fe0fc21fde8b227bc0aecf38a251fe40.avif?t=1739546695\" width=800 height=798 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cruel Fairy Tale Story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you purchase the illegal program [Raising Winions], you will be caught up in a shocking and cruel story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the twist story hidden behind the lovely graphics yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334660/extras/15838b45f83fae0055b0406ea79fdd87.avif?t=1739546695\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334660/extras/364844d72ea6e4c387f073f4a8a5abe4.poster.avif?t=1739546695\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334660/extras/364844d72ea6e4c387f073f4a8a5abe4.webm?t=1739546695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334660/extras/364844d72ea6e4c387f073f4a8a5abe4.mp4?t=1739546695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A perfect harmony of 2D and 3D</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in 3D games and work together with Minions to solve problems in the story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something familiar in the meadow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334660/extras/1d57365bdfd63e1c8a39af43ef5ff532.avif?t=1739546695\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bug that occurs in the computer...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actually, it's not a simple system error.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334660/extras/cfafa2665b53b40ff073847404e03e85.avif?t=1739546695\" data-has-big width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334660/extras/200e07ec7dc5c8066bbf0e23f2b87e4f.poster.avif?t=1739546695\" width=800 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334660/extras/200e07ec7dc5c8066bbf0e23f2b87e4f.webm?t=1739546695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334660/extras/200e07ec7dc5c8066bbf0e23f2b87e4f.mp4?t=1739546695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
